This licence covers the code in this repository. It does NOT cover:

  * The DECtalk DTC-01 firmware ROMs (Digital Equipment Corporation / Fonix).
    proprietary abandonware. are included here for program to work.

  * Musashi, the vendored Motorola 68000 emulation core in native/musashi/,
    which is Copyright Karl Stenerud and separately MIT licensed. Its licence
    is reproduced at native/musashi/LICENSE.txt.

  * The TMS32010 and SCN2681 emulation in native/, which was derived from
    MAME's BSD-3-Clause devices (src/devices/cpu/tms320c1x, and the DTC-01
    machine driver src/mame/dec/dectalk.cpp by Jonathan Gevaryahu). See
    DESIGN.md §1 for provenance.
